      "html": "<p>Every hotel room is checked and released many times a day. The check is part looks (clean, stocked) and part safety. Does the detector work? Does the fire door close? Does the restrictor hold? Has the unused shower been flushed? The building falls under the Regulatory Reform (Fire Safety) Order 2005 and general health and safety law. Most Faults are found on this walk. So the question is simple. Which tool records the check in the doorway and gets the Fault to the duty manager before check-in?</p>"
